flowchart TD
    START([Customer Signup + OTP]) --> KYC[KYC Verification]
    KYC --> POL[Connect / Upload Policy]
    POL --> IDX[Index Policy → ChromaDB]
    IDX --> W1[Step 1: Incident Details]
    W1 --> W2[Step 2: Policy Papers]
    W2 --> W3[Step 3: Evidence Upload]
    W3 --> W4[Step 4: Review & Submit]
    W4 --> AI[AI Multi-Agent Pipeline]
    AI --> D{Decision}

    D -->|Auto| AC[ANALYSIS_COMPLETE]
    D -->|Auto| AR[APPROVED / REJECTED]
    D -->|Escalate| PR[PENDING_REVIEW]
    D -->|Missing docs| RMI[REQUEST_MORE_INFO]
    RMI --> W3

    PR --> AG[Policy Agent Review]
    AG --> SI[SUBMITTED_TO_INSURER]
    SI --> INS[Insurer Final Decision]

    AC & AR & INS --> AUDIT[Audit Report + Tracking]
